        <item>
            <title>wdrop 1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 11:50:26 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<h3>改进</h3>
<ul><li>应用和菜单栏换用弧口口袋图标</li><li>敏感内容隐藏时，卡片名称统一打码</li><li>自动检查更新间隔缩短为每 2 小时</li><li>版本后的次数重新计数，首次不显示括号</li></ul>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul><li>App and menu bar icons now use the curved pocket design</li><li>Card titles are now masked whenever sensitive content is hidden</li><li>Automatic update checks now run every 2 hours</li><li>Version counters restart for each version, with no parentheses on the first build</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/yepyeel/wdrop-updates/releases/download/v1.1.0-build.6/wdrop-1.1.0.dmg" length="11098973" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="pQYtp7ThkUPmo0Aodma9VvG/Jrcq2XFNGtTpEa8frBsMFaPeAlulQcCRf5cpOatiFSz+Ppx4zzdUa1VzftqcDw=="/>
